<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Imp prices, inflation.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Imp prices, inflation.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR     PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					   DATA		   DATE</p>
<p> Import prices     Aug	-0.3 m/m, +0.5 y/y	 Sept 23</p>
<p> Inflation, prelim Sept     -0.1 m/m, +1.4 y/y	 Sept 26-27</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
